    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1683-a2">

                <pb facs="1429" n="1325" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1325"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure. 2.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the American Consul General
                        at Smyrna.</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1683-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 9, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram July 9. Protest vigorously. I am doing the same.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1683-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1683-f1-content">
                <p>For the reply to this telegram, see the Inclosure with Mr. Rockhill’s No. 245 of
                    July 12.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
